# Secure Mail Console

A bulk email streaming dashboard built with Express, Nodemailer, and Web SSE.

## Features
- Real-time event streaming for email sending status updates.
- Passkey protection & Cloudflare Turnstile integration.
- Template tags (`{Name}`, `{FirstName}`, `{Domain}`) & Spintax processing.

## Running Locally
```bash
npm install
npm start
